<view class="login-page">
  <view class="hero-block">
    <text class="hero-title">商家后台登录</text>
    <text class="hero-desc">扫码进入后，将直接登录当前商家的 B 端工作台。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="entry-card">
    <view class="entry-card__header">
      <text class="entry-card__title">当前扫码商家</text>
      <text class="entry-card__status" wx:if="{{entryLoading}}">识别中...</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{merchantEntry && merchantEntry.merchantId}}" class="entry-card__body">
      <text class="entry-card__name">{{merchantEntry.merchantName || '未命名商家'}}</text>
      <text class="entry-card__meta" wx:if="{{merchantEntry.contact}}">联系人：{{merchantEntry.contact}}</text>
      <text class="entry-card__meta" wx:if="{{merchantEntry.phone}}">联系电话：{{merchantEntry.phone}}</text>
      <text class="entry-card__meta">商家ID：{{merchantEntry.merchantId}}</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:else class="entry-card__empty">
      <text>请先扫描平台后台分配的商家后台入口码，再进行登录。</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="login-panel">
    <view class="input-group">
      <text class="panel-label">登录账号</text>
      <input class="login-input" placeholder="请输入店长或店员账号" value="{{username}}" bindinput="onUsernameInput" />
    </view>
    <view class="input-group">
      <text class="panel-label">密码</text>
      <input class="login-input" password placeholder="请输入密码" value="{{password}}" bindinput="onPasswordInput" />
    </view>
    <button class="primary-btn login-btn" bindtap="submitLogin" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}">登录</button>
    <view class="login-tip">
      <text>账号和密码由平台后台或店长创建；员工也使用这里登录当前商家后台。</text>
    </view>
    <view class="apply-entry" bindtap="goApply">
      <text>还没有店铺？</text>
      <text class="apply-link">商家入驻申请</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
